[{"id":"sadaqa-29-3-8","words":["verb:sadaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"rekli su istinu","en":"they told the truth"},{"bs":"istinu si rekao","en":"you have told the truth"},{"bs":"ispunili smo im obećanje","en":"we fulfilled our promise to them"},{"bs":"rekao je istinu","en":"he/it told the truth"}],"ref":"29:3","answerWord":"صَدَقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/ed7c527ff9aa951031fe.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We tested those who were before you. Thus Allah knoweth those who are sincere, and knoweth those who feign.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti istinu, biti iskren","en":"to tell the truth"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","فَتَنَّا","ٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","قَبْلِهِمْ","فَلَيَعْلَمَنَّ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","صَدَقُوا۟","وَلَيَعْلَمَنَّ","ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَقَ"}},{"id":"sadaqa-3-95-1","words":["verb:sadaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"rekao je istinu","en":"he/it told the truth"},{"bs":"ispunili smo im obećanje","en":"we fulfilled our promise to them"},{"bs":"ispunio vam je obećanje","en":"he/it fulfilled his promise to you (all)"},{"bs":"rekli su istinu","en":"they told the truth"}],"ref":"3:95","answerWord":"صَدَقَ","answerSound":"audio/059c2ee2433f7cc78943.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say: Allah speaketh truth. So follow the religion of Abraham, the upright. He was not of the idolaters.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti istinu, biti iskren","en":"to tell the truth"},"passage":["قُلْ","صَدَقَ","ٱللَّهُ","فَٱتَّبِعُوا۟","مِلَّةَ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","حَنِيفًا","وَمَا","كَانَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَقَ"}},{"id":"sadaqa-33-22-10","words":["verb:sadaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i rekao je istinu","en":"and he/it told the truth"},{"bs":"istinu si rekao","en":"you have told the truth"},{"bs":"ispunio nam je obećanje","en":"he/it fulfilled his promise to us"},{"bs":"pa je rekla istinu","en":"so she/it told the truth"}],"ref":"33:22","answerWord":"وَصَدَقَ","answerSound":"audio/9ef1ab1607a1d70eb3a5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when the true believers saw the clans, they said: This is that which Allah and His messenger promised us. Allah and His messenger are true. It did but confirm them in their faith and resignation.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti istinu, biti iskren","en":"to tell the truth"},"passage":["وَلَمَّا","رَءَا","ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","ٱلْأَحْزَابَ","قَالُوا۟","هَٰذَا","مَا","وَعَدَنَا","ٱللَّهُ","وَرَسُولُهُۥ","وَصَدَقَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَرَسُولُهُۥ","وَمَا","زَادَهُمْ","إِلَّآ","إِيمَٰنًا","وَتَسْلِيمًا"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَقَ"}},{"id":"sadaqa-5-113-10","words":["verb:sadaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"rekao si nam istinu","en":"you told us the truth"},{"bs":"rekli su istinu","en":"they told the truth"},{"bs":"pa je rekla istinu","en":"so she/it told the truth"},{"bs":"ispunio nam je obećanje","en":"he/it fulfilled his promise to us"}],"ref":"5:113","answerWord":"صَدَقْتَنَا","answerSound":"audio/8004deccf3e4aa085e18.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(They said:) We wish to eat thereof, that we may satisfy our hearts and know that thou hast spoken truth to us, and that thereof we may be witnesses.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti istinu, biti iskren","en":"to tell the truth"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","نُرِيدُ","أَن","نَّأْكُلَ","مِنْهَا","وَتَطْمَئِنَّ","قُلُوبُنَا","وَنَعْلَمَ","أَن","قَدْ","صَدَقْتَنَا","وَنَكُونَ","عَلَيْهَا","مِنَ","ٱلشَّٰهِدِينَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَقَ"}},{"id":"sadaqa-12-26-15","words":["verb:sadaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je rekla istinu","en":"so she/it told the truth"},{"bs":"ispunili smo im obećanje","en":"we fulfilled our promise to them"},{"bs":"ispunio nam je obećanje","en":"he/it fulfilled his promise to us"},{"bs":"istinu si rekao","en":"you have told the truth"}],"ref":"12:26","answerWord":"فَصَدَقَتْ","answerSound":"audio/1f7a950d5f75260dca21.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Joseph) said: She it was who asked of me an evil act. And a witness of her own folk testified: If his shirt is torn from before, then she speaketh truth and he is of the liars.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti istinu, biti iskren","en":"to tell the truth"},"passage":["قَالَ","هِىَ","رَٰوَدَتْنِى","عَن","نَّفْسِى","وَشَهِدَ","شَاهِدٌ","مِّنْ","أَهْلِهَآ","إِن","كَانَ","قَمِيصُهُۥ","قُدَّ","مِن","قُبُلٍ","فَصَدَقَتْ","وَهُوَ","مِنَ","ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَقَ"}},{"id":"sadaqa-21-9-1","words":["verb:sadaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"ispunili smo im obećanje","en":"we fulfilled our promise to them"},{"bs":"ispunio vam je obećanje","en":"he/it fulfilled his promise to you (all)"},{"bs":"istinu si rekao","en":"you have told the truth"},{"bs":"pa je rekla istinu","en":"so she/it told the truth"}],"ref":"21:9","answerWord":"صَدَقْنَٰهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/c53f14065db9163c73bb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then we fulfilled the promise unto them. So we delivered them and whom We would, and We destroyed the prodigals.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti istinu, biti iskren","en":"to tell the truth"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","صَدَقْنَٰهُمُ","ٱلْوَعْدَ","فَأَنجَيْنَٰهُمْ","وَمَن","نَّشَآءُ","وَأَهْلَكْنَا","ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَقَ"}},{"id":"sadaqa-27-27-2","words":["verb:sadaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"istinu si rekao","en":"you have told the truth"},{"bs":"ispunio vam je obećanje","en":"he/it fulfilled his promise to you (all)"},{"bs":"rekao si nam istinu","en":"you told us the truth"},{"bs":"pa je rekla istinu","en":"so she/it told the truth"}],"ref":"27:27","answerWord":"أَصَدَقْتَ","answerSound":"audio/8dd6786df8557d92baca.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Solomon) said: We shall see whether thou speakest truth or whether thou art of the liars.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti istinu, biti iskren","en":"to tell the truth"},"passage":["قَالَ","سَنَنظُرُ","أَصَدَقْتَ","أَمْ","كُنتَ","مِنَ","ٱلْكَٰذِبِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَقَ"}},{"id":"sadaqa-39-74-4","words":["verb:sadaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"ispunio nam je obećanje","en":"he/it fulfilled his promise to us"},{"bs":"ispunili smo im obećanje","en":"we fulfilled our promise to them"},{"bs":"rekao je istinu","en":"he/it told the truth"},{"bs":"pa je rekla istinu","en":"so she/it told the truth"}],"ref":"39:74","answerWord":"صَدَقَنَا","answerSound":"audio/dcd1187c638c4e022b72.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They say: Praise be to Allah, Who hath fulfilled His promise unto us and hath made us inherit the land, sojourning in the Garden where we will! So bounteous is the wage of workers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"govoriti istinu, biti iskren","en":"to tell the truth"},"passage":["وَقَالُوا۟","ٱلْحَمْدُ","لِلَّهِ","ٱلَّذِى","صَدَقَنَا","وَعْدَهُۥ","وَأَوْرَثَنَا","ٱلْأَرْضَ","نَتَبَوَّأُ","مِنَ","ٱلْجَنَّةِ","حَيْثُ","نَشَآءُ","فَنِعْمَ","أَجْرُ","ٱلْعَٰمِلِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَقَ"}},{"id":"laqia-2-14-1","words":["verb:laqia"],"options":[{"bs":"sreli su","en":"they met"},{"bs":"sreli ste","en":"you (all) met"},{"bs":"susrećete je","en":"you (all) meet it"},{"bs":"sreli smo","en":"we met"}],"ref":"2:14","answerWord":"لَقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/6079ecd9d4fbee344cc8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they fall in with those who believe, they say: We believe; but when they go apart to their devils they declare: Lo! we are with you; verily we did but mock.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti, susresti","en":"to meet"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","لَقُوا۟","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","قَالُوٓا۟","ءَامَنَّا","وَإِذَا","خَلَوْا۟","إِلَىٰ","شَيَٰطِينِهِمْ","قَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّا","مَعَكُمْ","إِنَّمَا","نَحْنُ","مُسْتَهْزِءُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"لَقِيَ"}},{"id":"laqia-8-15-4","words":["verb:laqia"],"options":[{"bs":"sretnete","en":"you meet"},{"bs":"susreću","en":"they meet"},{"bs":"sreli su vas","en":"they met you (all)"},{"bs":"Ga sretnu","en":"they meet Him"}],"ref":"8:15","answerWord":"لَقِيتُمُ","answerSound":"audio/d809a02110ae09eab929.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! When ye meet those who disbelieve in battle, turn not your backs to them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti, susresti","en":"to meet"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِذَا","لَقِيتُمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","زَحْفًا","فَلَا","تُوَلُّوهُمُ","ٱلْأَدْبَارَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"لَقِيَ"}},{"id":"laqia-33-44-2","words":["verb:laqia"],"options":[{"bs":"Ga sretnu","en":"they meet Him"},{"bs":"nalazi je","en":"he/it finds it"},{"bs":"sretnete","en":"you meet"},{"bs":"sreli su vas","en":"they met you (all)"}],"ref":"33:44","answerWord":"يَلْقَوْنَهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/8c3b936e93d2c5a59bdd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Their salutation on the day when they shall meet Him will be: Peace. And He hath prepared for them a goodly recompense.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti, susresti","en":"to meet"},"passage":["تَحِيَّتُهُمْ","يَوْمَ","يَلْقَوْنَهُۥ","سَلَٰمٌ","وَأَعَدَّ","لَهُمْ","أَجْرًا","كَرِيمًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"لَقِيَ"}},{"id":"laqia-3-119-9","words":["verb:laqia"],"options":[{"bs":"sreli su vas","en":"they met you (all)"},{"bs":"Ga sretnu","en":"they meet Him"},{"bs":"susrećete je","en":"you (all) meet it"},{"bs":"sreli smo","en":"we met"}],"ref":"3:119","answerWord":"لَقُوكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/d6b3d7180d0c9cbb5da4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! ye are those who love them though they love you not, and ye believe in all the Scripture. When they fall in with you they say: We believe; but when they go apart they bite their finger-tips at you, for rage. Say: Perish in your rage! Lo! Allah is Aware of what is hidden in (your) breasts.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti, susresti","en":"to meet"},"passage":["هَٰٓأَنتُمْ","أُو۟لَآءِ","تُحِبُّونَهُمْ","وَلَا","يُحِبُّونَكُمْ","وَتُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱلْكِتَٰبِ","كُلِّهِۦ","وَإِذَا","لَقُوكُمْ","قَالُوٓا۟","ءَامَنَّا","وَإِذَا","خَلَوْا۟","عَضُّوا۟","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْأَنَامِلَ","مِنَ","ٱلْغَيْظِ","قُلْ","مُوتُوا۟","بِغَيْظِكُمْ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","عَلِيمٌۢ","بِذَاتِ","ٱلصُّدُورِ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"لَقِيَ"}},{"id":"laqia-3-143-7","words":["verb:laqia"],"options":[{"bs":"susrećete je","en":"you (all) meet it"},{"bs":"sreli su","en":"they (two) met"},{"bs":"sretnete","en":"you meet"},{"bs":"susreću","en":"they meet"}],"ref":"3:143","answerWord":"تَلْقَوْهُ","answerSound":"audio/a0dfc464b9e7ae4c0eee.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And verily ye used to wish for death before ye met it (in the field). Now ye have seen it with your eyes!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti, susresti","en":"to meet"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","كُنتُمْ","تَمَنَّوْنَ","ٱلْمَوْتَ","مِن","قَبْلِ","أَن","تَلْقَوْهُ","فَقَدْ","رَأَيْتُمُوهُ","وَأَنتُمْ","تَنظُرُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"لَقِيَ"}},{"id":"laqia-8-45-4","words":["verb:laqia"],"options":[{"bs":"sreli ste","en":"you (all) met"},{"bs":"susreće","en":"he/it meets"},{"bs":"sreli smo","en":"we met"},{"bs":"sreli su","en":"they met"}],"ref":"8:45","answerWord":"لَقِيتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/793368debf97cdb252d8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! When ye meet an army, hold firm and think of Allah much, that ye may be successful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti, susresti","en":"to meet"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِذَا","لَقِيتُمْ","فِئَةً","فَٱثْبُتُوا۟","وَٱذْكُرُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","كَثِيرًا","لَّعَلَّكُمْ","تُفْلِحُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"لَقِيَ"}},{"id":"laqia-17-13-11","words":["verb:laqia"],"options":[{"bs":"nalazi je","en":"he/it finds it"},{"bs":"sreli smo","en":"we met"},{"bs":"sreli su","en":"they (two) met"},{"bs":"sretnete","en":"you meet"}],"ref":"17:13","answerWord":"يَلْقَىٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/6959c4225d1900604c48.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And every man's augury have We fastened to his own neck, and We shall bring forth for him on the Day of Resurrection a book which he will find wide open.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti, susresti","en":"to meet"},"passage":["وَكُلَّ","إِنسَٰنٍ","أَلْزَمْنَٰهُ","طَٰٓئِرَهُۥ","فِى","عُنُقِهِۦ","وَنُخْرِجُ","لَهُۥ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","كِتَٰبًا","يَلْقَىٰهُ","مَنشُورًا"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"لَقِيَ"}},{"id":"laqia-18-62-7","words":["verb:laqia"],"options":[{"bs":"sreli smo","en":"we met"},{"bs":"sreli su","en":"they met"},{"bs":"nalazi je","en":"he/it finds it"},{"bs":"susreću","en":"they meet"}],"ref":"18:62","answerWord":"لَقِينَا","answerSound":"audio/e69a4d6a53d612ce90a0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they had gone further, he said unto his servant: Bring us our breakfast. Verily we have found fatigue in this our journey.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti, susresti","en":"to meet"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","جَاوَزَا","قَالَ","لِفَتَىٰهُ","ءَاتِنَا","غَدَآءَنَا","لَقَدْ","لَقِينَا","مِن","سَفَرِنَا","هَٰذَا","نَصَبًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"لَقِيَ"}},{"id":"laqia-18-74-3","words":["verb:laqia"],"options":[{"bs":"sreli su","en":"they (two) met"},{"bs":"sreli smo","en":"we met"},{"bs":"susreću","en":"they meet"},{"bs":"sreli su vas","en":"they met you (all)"}],"ref":"18:74","answerWord":"لَقِيَا","answerSound":"audio/f09bf14679b2e685c73a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So they twain journeyed on till, when they met a lad, he slew him. (Moses) said: What! Hast thou slain an innocent soul who hath slain no man? Verily thou hast done a horrid thing.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti, susresti","en":"to meet"},"passage":["فَٱنطَلَقَا","حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَا","لَقِيَا","غُلَٰمًا","فَقَتَلَهُۥ","قَالَ","أَقَتَلْتَ","نَفْسًا","زَكِيَّةًۢ","بِغَيْرِ","نَفْسٍ","لَّقَدْ","جِئْتَ","شَيْـًٔا","نُّكْرًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"لَقِيَ"}},{"id":"laqia-19-59-9","words":["verb:laqia"],"options":[{"bs":"susreću","en":"they meet"},{"bs":"Ga sretnu","en":"they meet Him"},{"bs":"sreli ste","en":"you (all) met"},{"bs":"sreli su","en":"they met"}],"ref":"19:59","answerWord":"يَلْقَوْنَ","answerSound":"audio/ddd86a1ed87e61c1f65a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Now there hath succeeded them a later generation whom have ruined worship and have followed lusts. But they will meet deception.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti, susresti","en":"to meet"},"passage":["فَخَلَفَ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِمْ","خَلْفٌ","أَضَاعُوا۟","ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","وَٱتَّبَعُوا۟","ٱلشَّهَوَٰتِ","فَسَوْفَ","يَلْقَوْنَ","غَيًّا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"لَقِيَ"}},{"id":"laqia-25-68-20","words":["verb:laqia"],"options":[{"bs":"susreće","en":"he/it meets"},{"bs":"sretnete","en":"you meet"},{"bs":"susrećete je","en":"you (all) meet it"},{"bs":"sreli smo","en":"we met"}],"ref":"25:68","answerWord":"يَلْقَ","answerSound":"audio/08a7504214b689fa8b65.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who cry not unto any other god along with Allah, nor take the life which Allah hath forbidden save in (course of) justice, nor commit adultery - and whoso doeth this shall pay the penalty;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"sresti, susresti","en":"to meet"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يَدْعُونَ","مَعَ","ٱللَّهِ","إِلَٰهًا","ءَاخَرَ","وَلَا","يَقْتُلُونَ","ٱلنَّفْسَ","ٱلَّتِى","حَرَّمَ","ٱللَّهُ","إِلَّا","بِٱلْحَقِّ","وَلَا","يَزْنُونَ","وَمَن","يَفْعَلْ","ذَٰلِكَ","يَلْقَ","أَثَامًا"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"لَقِيَ"}}]